cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SocioVerse-ABM, please cite the SocioVerse2 technical report below."
title: "SocioVerse-ABM"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lishi905/SocioVerse-ABM"
url: "https://socioverse.fudan-disc.com/"
abstract: >-
  SocioVerse-ABM replaces the rule-based agents of classic agent-based models with LLM
  agents that receive the same observations and return the same typed actions, and
  benchmarks whether the LLM agents reproduce the collective behavior of the rules. It is
  the ABM benchmark companion of SocioVerse2.
keywords:
  - agent-based modeling
  - LLM agents
  - social simulation
  - benchmark
  - computational social science
authors:
  - name: "The SocioVerse2 Authors"
